Introduction to English: English is a global language. It helps in communication, reading, and writing.
Grammar Basics: Nouns, verbs, adjectives, and adverbs. Sentence structure.
Reading Comprehension: Understanding stories and poems.
Writing Skills: Letter writing, essay writing, and creative writing.
Vocabulary Building: Learning new words and their meanings.
Spelling Rules: Common spelling patterns and exceptions.
Oral Communication: Speaking clearly and listening actively.
Literature: Famous authors and their works.
Language in Daily Life: Using English in various situations.
Importance of English: Career opportunities and global connectivity.
